    "description": "Provide object-oriented software (OOS) design and development for innovative, customer facing payment solutions\n Achievement Highlights:\nCredit Card Payments - Led project for integration of credit card bill payments with existing money movement engine and implemented WSDL JAX-RS service for processing payment card authorizations\n \nDesign, develop, and deploy key middleware components to support PCI security and compliance\nAchievement Highlights:\nLead developer and designer of solutions to ensure PCI security and compliance\nImplement methods to secure payment card data with vendor software\nEstablish long term processes for control and access to PCI data\n \nSupport, maintain, and continuously improve internally developed and vendor-based solutions for enterprise business processes and high-volume, real-time customer-facing money movement transactions (100+ million transactions daily)\nAchievement Highlights:\nPerform vendor software migrations, upgrades, and defect resolution for on premise Clear Commerce payment card system and PEP+ mainframe system \nConsult with delivery partners on new projects providing guidance, reviews, and oversight ensuring delivery of efficient, maintainable solutions maximizing high code re-use\nAutomate and improve system refresh cycles reducing cycle time from one week to one hour for five mainframe test systems\nIntroduce methodologies and best practices that enhance product definition, release processes and customization of applications\n\nSupport, maintain and develop new features for internally developed solution for enterprise content generation of documents for delivery. \nAchievement Highlights:\nDevelop and automate testing of new feature involving expiration of requests based on client preference. \nDevelop and test modification of feature to track processing of requests from clients from receipt to delivery and reconciliation.",
